Native multi-agent gap closure — F-RT-03 same-host ACP recovery follow-up
Date: 2026-09-09 (Asia/Shanghai)
Scope: explicit ACP local cold replacement only; no cross-host ACP or remote-supervisor claim.

Implementation:
- Added `acp-local-cold-replace` recovery schema with profile, workspace cwd, and exact process identity.
- ACP provider records the descriptor only when recovery is configured and registers a matching local fencer.
- Activation controller restores ACP cwd for persisted-resume replacement.
- Startup recovery selects the configured recovery kind; default remains `sdk-local-cold-replace`.

